# Agent rule files, in one command, never overwriting yours.
#
# GENERATED shape, hand-written content. Re-record with `make -C demo`.
Source common.tape
Source setup.tape
Output out/seed.gif
Set Height 520

Sleep 700ms
Type "chute seed"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "ls -1 CLAUDE.md AGENTS.md .cursorrules SCRATCHPAD.md"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Sleep 1.2s
